    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123980/extras/7234868ab6c83674791c3d8ee8d56299.avif?t=1746123117\" width=800 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The passengers open their eyes in a cemetery. They are surrounded by uncertainty and fear. Their mission: to find and deactivate a radioactive bomb. This dangerous journey begins by train, but it is no ordinary trip. At each stop, a new mystery awaits; in every carriage, another nightmare lurks. The conductor they encounter and the eerie events complicate the mission further. Affected by the bomb, the train drifts into unknown dimensions. Each stop holds dark secrets from the past and challenging trials. This journey is not just a mission; it is also a battle to discover their own identities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123980/extras/47b1c7a8cd204532476eb034dbcede97.poster.avif?t=1746123117\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123980/extras/47b1c7a8cd204532476eb034dbcede97.webm?t=1746123117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123980/extras/47b1c7a8cd204532476eb034dbcede97.mp4?t=1746123117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123980/extras/9d76ebe2f9ee53b3e47cbdf392da2ff0.avif?t=1746123117\" width=800 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this unique train adventure, you don't just move from one wagon to another. Some doors open to different worlds, interactions, and side stories. As you step into a seemingly normal wagon, you find yourself in an entirely different place, sharing this experience with other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123980/extras/bbf5924e7fad0718a0ed5cbb9e0067b8.poster.avif?t=1746123117\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123980/extras/bbf5924e7fad0718a0ed5cbb9e0067b8.webm?t=1746123117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123980/extras/bbf5924e7fad0718a0ed5cbb9e0067b8.mp4?t=1746123117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123980/extras/8f1922af43b3c4e2fa160273d064df6c.avif?t=1746123117\" width=800 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The stations add an extra layer of excitement to the journey. Each station acts as a gateway to dark secrets, with random creatures lurking behind these doors. These creatures guard hidden perils deep within the stations. Players must discover useful items and locate the kit required to neutralize the bomb. Time is of the essence; the mission must be completed before the train departs. In this race against time, find the bombs and survive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123980/extras/3d84b5b5d3589386e861461ce5770c50.poster.avif?t=1746123117\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123980/extras/3d84b5b5d3589386e861461ce5770c50.webm?t=1746123117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123980/extras/3d84b5b5d3589386e861461ce5770c50.mp4?t=1746123117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123980/extras/7234868ab6c83674791c3d8ee8d56299.avif?t=1746123117\" width=800 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The passengers open their eyes in a cemetery. They are surrounded by uncertainty and fear. Their mission: to find and deactivate a radioactive bomb. This dangerous journey begins by train, but it is no ordinary trip. At each stop, a new mystery awaits; in every carriage, another nightmare lurks. The conductor they encounter and the eerie events complicate the mission further. Affected by the bomb, the train drifts into unknown dimensions. Each stop holds dark secrets from the past and challenging trials. This journey is not just a mission; it is also a battle to discover their own identities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123980/extras/47b1c7a8cd204532476eb034dbcede97.poster.avif?t=1746123117\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123980/extras/47b1c7a8cd204532476eb034dbcede97.webm?t=1746123117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123980/extras/47b1c7a8cd204532476eb034dbcede97.mp4?t=1746123117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123980/extras/9d76ebe2f9ee53b3e47cbdf392da2ff0.avif?t=1746123117\" width=800 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this unique train adventure, you don't just move from one wagon to another. Some doors open to different worlds, interactions, and side stories. As you step into a seemingly normal wagon, you find yourself in an entirely different place, sharing this experience with other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123980/extras/bbf5924e7fad0718a0ed5cbb9e0067b8.poster.avif?t=1746123117\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123980/extras/bbf5924e7fad0718a0ed5cbb9e0067b8.webm?t=1746123117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123980/extras/bbf5924e7fad0718a0ed5cbb9e0067b8.mp4?t=1746123117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123980/extras/8f1922af43b3c4e2fa160273d064df6c.avif?t=1746123117\" width=800 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The stations add an extra layer of excitement to the journey. Each station acts as a gateway to dark secrets, with random creatures lurking behind these doors. These creatures guard hidden perils deep within the stations. Players must discover useful items and locate the kit required to neutralize the bomb. Time is of the essence; the mission must be completed before the train departs. In this race against time, find the bombs and survive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123980/extras/3d84b5b5d3589386e861461ce5770c50.poster.avif?t=1746123117\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123980/extras/3d84b5b5d3589386e861461ce5770c50.webm?t=1746123117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123980/extras/3d84b5b5d3589386e861461ce5770c50.mp4?t=1746123117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "In this 4-player online co-op horror game, you embark on an adventure by summoning a mysterious train. You must find and defuse bombs in an 8-carriage train. However, beware, there's a blind conductor and dangerous creatures chasing you. Race against time, find the bombs, and survive!",
